  1837	// base file; gating on the base file alone would treat such a local-only repo
  1838	// as inactive and make every hook a silent no-op, dropping all checkpoint
  1839	// capture for that documented workflow. The IsSetUpAny guard is still required
  1840	// so a never-enabled repo (no settings file in any scope) is not treated as
  1841	// enabled by Load's default Enabled: true. Any settings read error is treated
  1842	// as disabled (fail closed).
